Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:08.22,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蝴蝶效应3： 启示》
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.90,0:44:33.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪者：德伯格）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 乔希\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Josh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.26,0:01:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我数到3\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm counting to 3, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不走我要生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm going to get mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,1…\N{\fnArial\fs30}1…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,2…\N{\fnArial\fs30}2…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,2.5…\N{\fnArial\fs30}2.5…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭想吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚才吃过中国菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had Chinese last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都得吃中国菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to eat it every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要成为功夫大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a kung fu master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 秀几招 小成龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, show me your moves, Jackie Chan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的比赛你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for your tournament tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我要打到他血流不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm going to make him bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他哭着求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make him cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打得他哭着回家找妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make him run home to his mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打谁？- 迈克尔 我讨厌他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Michael. I hate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 好像 是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, like, your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他老是数落别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he picks on people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也数落你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he pick on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他妈妈谈谈这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to talk to his mother about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,记下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write this down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午7点12分\N{\fnArial\fs30}7:12 p.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想知道 你觉得我这么做事为了什么好处吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do. You think I do this for the great benefits package?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 别忘了今天你还有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, don't forget your shrink appointment today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想听到你又换到另一个的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear you skipped another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 谢谢 珍娜 谢谢你的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thanks, Jenna. Thanks for helping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你在我穿梭时空的时候 保持我的大脑稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for keeping my brain stable while I jump through time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢 塞姆 我很乐意帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem, Sam. Glad I could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会做的菜有… 熏肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that she can cook… meatloaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到家的时候 她穿着睡衣…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got home, and she's wearing her negligee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧到嘴巴时 那个效果还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's good if you burn your mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个就是通灵的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the psychic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laugh all you want, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个通灵的人已经 把22个坏蛋关进监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that psychic's put 22 perps behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把车开走了 但抢车不是他的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the car, but it's not what he was after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钱包？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标就是她 他是专门来杀她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her. He was there to kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谋杀… 买凶杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a hit… murder for hire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 是谁买凶的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who hired him, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他手机的通话记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in his cell phone records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,7点12分他打了一个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a phone call 12 after 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说嘛 他怎么知道这些的？- 不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. How does he know this stuff? - Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找她前夫的电话记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ex-husband's phone records.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他在那晚的7点12分有没有接到电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if he received a call at 7:12 that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为孩子没受到伤害 我觉得前夫有嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspected the ex, the way that kid's left unharmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 大侦探 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Detective, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.74,0:05:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子不是没受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid wasn't unharmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到他妈妈被打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw his mother bludgeoned to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计我的支票在楼下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume my check is downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么知道这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you know what you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道你像巫师那样灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know that you ain't no psychic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看我是不是错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说我妻子和我说的第一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me the first thing my wife ever said to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的巫师会知道这些琐事的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real psychics know that kind of shit, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大侦探 我等你的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look forward to your next call, Detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这个月和下个月的帐都结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this ought to settle us up for this month and next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看你 谁说你不是个窝心的小宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. Ain't you the sweetest thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照顾你的姐姐的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you take care of your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像南瓜派那样甜蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}About as sweet as pumpkin pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你的确是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你小嘴上的奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sweet is pumpkin pie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,做成的南瓜派该有多甜啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some whipped cream on that sweet little ass of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 呃 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually got to get going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还要拿着些冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I got ice cream in the groceries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去认识我的侄女罗克珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to introduce you to my niece Roxanne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣幸之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to meet her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我把她的电话给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll get her number for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这别走 我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay right there. I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听到我敲门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't hear me knocking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是你在敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你认为是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you think it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖世太保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gestapo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这开过窗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever open up a window in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 没格调了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, and lose the ambiance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不相信昨晚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna believe what happened last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁的卡罗维茨斯夫妇一直吵到很晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kalowitzes next door were up late fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来讲讲好的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get to the good part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用了「离」字开头的绝招\N{\fnArial\fs30}She drops the D-bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divorce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来3-B房间就快要空出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it looks like Apartment 3-B might be opening up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以住过来 我们就是邻居了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could grab it. We could be neighbors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这样你就可以整夜偷听我的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, then you could stay up late eavesdropping on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 是的 偷听你刺激的社交生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Eavesdropping on your exciting social life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西会他妈的害死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things will fucking kill ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作进展如何 警察巫师先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how was work, Mr. Police Psychic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出来在公园杀害妈妈的是谁了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ever find out who killed Mommy in the park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定身份了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get an I. D?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是前夫雇的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was some gun the ex hired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是前夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always the ex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在佩吉和凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should warn Peggy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,离婚之前 我要去给她个警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she serves Kevin those divorce papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 你就不得不搬出公寓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do that, you'd actually have to leave your apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. That was just a joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我搬出公寓就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I leave my apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我今天早晨去看了心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I went out just this morning to see my psychoanalyst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 说真的 珍娜 那… 那真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously, Jenna. That's… That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she have to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她同意我的看法 对火灾中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She agreed with me that it's really unhealthy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生的事情闭口不谈是不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we never talk about what happened in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 我对那情况知道的越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that the more I know about what happened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就越少受其困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more I'll be free of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 能聊聊那件事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. Can we talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好聊的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is there to talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 你要为这付出代价吗 还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, were you gonna pay this, or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察说是瓦斯泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police said that it was a gas leak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是从外面回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you came in from outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到烟味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smelled smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道烟是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know where it was coming from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是邻居家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was the neighbor's house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我出去看看 - 你还找到了梯子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so I went outside to look. - And you got a ladder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 这完全说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - It just doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有时间跑去棚子 还找到了梯子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you have time to go to the shed and get a ladder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白的 我不记得了 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't remember, Jenna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想记得 那时我只有15岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to remember! I was 15 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吗 珍娜？审问结束了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that enough, Jenna? Is the interrogation over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱里有冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice cream's in the freezer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我买零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the groceries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想过来吃晚饭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to come over for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以做个煲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could make a casserole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我明天过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll come by tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 我们还是三年级吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we, in the third grade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinky swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.09,0:10:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上睡个好觉 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep tonight, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白布朗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Brown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡的妹妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca's sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你还是很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 是 还好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Yes. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 我帮你腾个座儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me clean off this seat for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不了 塞姆 别麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't. Sam, don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些垃圾扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this crap out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what brings you to my part of town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来… 我来是为了那死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came… I came back for the execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们周五要处死罗尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're executing Lonnie on Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal injection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼… 罗尼弗莱内斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie… Lonnie Flennons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy that ki…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为杀死丽贝卡的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy they say killed Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你不知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You act like you don't know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我… 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是好久没想起丽贝卡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hadn't thought about Rebecca in a long time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这是干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼没有杀害我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie didn't kill my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你怎么知道？- 好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how do you know that? - Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在帮父母搬家时 发现了这本日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I found this diary when I was helping my parents move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡写的很多都是你 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca wrote about you a lot, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于她是多么爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how much she loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼在审判时试图说服陪审团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie tried to convince the jury during the trial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 相信他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, you know, they were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恋爱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}having a relationship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还记得吗？- 对 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you remember? - Yeah, I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was true, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡对你不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca was cheating on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 1998年五月18号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. May 18th, 1998.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「有人一直在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Someone has been following me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's definitely not Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还不知道罗尼 可我得告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He doesn't know about Lonnie, but I have to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉如此愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I feel so guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把日记带给了警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took this diary to the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是确切证据 不能重新开庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not sufficient evidence to reopen the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 要是他们这么说… - 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, if that's what they say… - And then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你的朋友谈过 格伦侦探？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to your friend. Detective Glenn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我你有办法了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}he told me that you have a way of knowing things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人不知道的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that nobody else knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说… 说你能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… That you can…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}see into crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我想要雇你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I want to hire you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有5000美元现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have $5, 000 in cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:13:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不行 伊丽莎白 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't, Elizabeth. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.57,0:14:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很麻烦 我很抱歉 - 麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's complicated. I'm sorry. - Complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害丽贝卡的凶手逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}the guy that killed Rebecca got away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而罗尼弗莱内斯 一个无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lonnie Flennons, an innocent man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个她所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man she loved, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒希望能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会想要你留着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have wanted you to have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就 呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说那个死去的女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about this dead girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you love her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca Brown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我第一个为之倾心的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}first girl I ever fell for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前从没想过回到过去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never thought about jumping back before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想过一百次了 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought about it a hundred times. I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会更了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd know better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 这是个严肃的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this is serious shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两大条规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two big rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不能回去改变自己的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never jump back to alter your own past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你决不能在无人监管时回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never jump unsupervised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我只是回去而没人看到我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I just go back and nobody sees me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我完全按你教的只是观察呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do exactly as you taught me and just observe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 伙计 别自欺欺人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's be honest with ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think that you can go back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睁睁地看着你的女朋友被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch your girlfriend get murdered, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 却无动于衷吗？- 我曾看到许多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and not intervene? - I've seen dozens of people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我眼前被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed right before my eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,却什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I haven't lifted a finger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 这可不一样 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is different, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己见识过 要是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen for yourself what happens if you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你打破规矩会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you break these rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹死于火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister dies in a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回到过去 以为你能救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jump back, thinking you can save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没料到 取而代之\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you didn't expect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}was that your parents were gonna die instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试图拯救一条人命 你却害死了两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to save one life. You kill two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你了解规矩之前你要回去多少次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times you gotta jump back before you know the rules?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,15次？20次？知道我不会再那样就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}15? 20? Enough to know I don't want to do it any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 你知道吗 你都快把脑袋弄糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. You know, you nearly fried your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复那么多次你会受不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't handle that many overlaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会让你发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll drive you crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们再来一杯吧 甜心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get another round here, sweetheart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧 德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it, Goldburg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大一物理给了我个「F」 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me an "F" in freshman physics, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远也不会让我忘了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna let me live it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.55,0:16:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给小费 我可能会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start tipping, I might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很难 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不管什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for whatever reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女人丽贝卡必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}your girl Rebecca had to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我必须得忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've had to live with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不去拯救某人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not saving someone's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不意味着是杀害他们 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't the same thing as killing them, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做好事 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do a good thing, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给人们带来很多了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring a lot of closure to people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody but myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能继续活在过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop living in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把这个女孩抛在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get this girl out of your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也见不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna see her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是想帮助这个可怜的死囚区杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you want to help this poor death-row bastard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好在当前找个办法来解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you better find a way to do it in the here and now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是我前妻跟一个他妈的园丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like my ex-wife used to say before she{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑去厄瓜多尔之前总爱说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran off to Ecuador with the fucking gardener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得活在当下 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta live in the moment, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯算我请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's on the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄油乳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A buttery nipple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.05,0:18:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,维基 我现在想独自静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicky, I need to be alone right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是会挑人 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really know how to pick 'em, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.41,0:19:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是… 你是同志吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you… Are you gay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把你介绍给我的朋友布伦丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could introduce you to my friend Brendan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是个同志 也许你们能在一块儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gay, too. Maybe you guys could hang out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我肯定会给你他的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be sure to give you his number, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们能去 你知道 做些男人的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can go, you know, do man things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 利兹 我是塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Liz. It's Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 罗尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lonnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆瑞德 记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Reide. Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,南庞蒂克高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Pontiac High.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,南庞蒂克灰熊队\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Pontiac Grizzly Bears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这儿帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 罗尼 我知道你没有杀害丽贝卡布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Lonnie. I know you didn't kill Rebecca Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 罗尼 说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Lonnie. Say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿嘲笑我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to laugh at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 听着 罗尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look, Lonnie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你爱着丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you loved Rebecca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她写了关于你的一切 就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wrote all about it, right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能重新开庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get a new trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 罗尼 我觉得你没听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Lonnie. I don't think you heard me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个新的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is new evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察不想重审这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police don't want to reopen the case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们能申请缓刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can request a stay of execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的证据 重新开庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}New evidence. New trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会被释放的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll be exonerated. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.17,0:22:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听懂了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会把这带给你的律师 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sending this to your lawyer. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.05,0:22:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼你能不能就看看这日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie, would you just look at the diary!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿被关了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been locked in here for 10 years!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.93,0:22:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能来这儿这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't come in here and do this to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.53,0:22:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能现在来装好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't pretend to be the good guy now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你做的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.31,0:23:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 是你做的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. You did it, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.71,0:23:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也习惯不了这种冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never get used to this cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么今晚的主题是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's on the menu tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀？强奸？还是汽车肇事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homicide? Rape? Vehicular manslaughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你这是在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把号码给我就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在违反规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're breaking the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打破的是我的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my rules to break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.29,0:23:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了她的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save her, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:23:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在这里通过安全的方式进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this here, the safe way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者在家里 独自承担风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I can do it at home by myself and risk everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞姆… - 不论哪种方式 我都会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… - Either way, I'm gonna do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,1998年 6月6日\N{\fnArial\fs30}June 6th, 1998.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶杀案发生于上午12：40左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder happened approximately 12:40 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.73,0:24:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是星期六\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在那边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a fucking gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.41,0:25:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,利兹 利兹 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz. Liz. It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 周末我父母不在镇里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. My parents are out of town this weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.25,0:25:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不是… 来嘛 - 我有些葡萄酒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no… - Come on. I got some wine coolers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.79,0:25:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝基叫它「泼妇酒」 - 关上门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Becky calls it "bitch beer." - Lock the doors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.29,0:25:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来点泼妇酒吗？- 回到车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want some bitch beer? - Get back in the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.96,0:25:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会回车上的… - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not getting back in my car… - Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.39,0:25:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很危险 我是认真的 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger. This is serious, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到车里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.90,0:25:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,成吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.67,0:25:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the doors locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.81,0:25:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到什么 就按喇叭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see anything, honk your horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.21,0:25:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.08,0:28:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth! Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.47,0:28:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.24,0:28:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.61,0:28:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 不记得了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paco. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.21,0:28:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我租了你的沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rent your couch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出租了我的沙发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rent out my couch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是缺钱了 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the recession, pendejo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.79,0:28:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的汽车钥匙在哪？- 汽车钥匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are my car keys? - Car keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有汽车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.66,0:29:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop showing up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.29,0:29:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要关于丽贝卡布朗谋杀案的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the case file on the Rebecca Brown murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.09,0:29:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.25,0:29:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是10年前布朗谋杀案的一名嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a suspect in the Brown murder 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.35,0:29:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在他无法摆脱这案子的困扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he's obsessed with the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.05,0:29:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你觉得他能成我们的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think he might be our guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他只是个失落的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's just a lost soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.89,0:29:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 给他一些其它的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's show him the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.03,0:29:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他是杀人犯 我们会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's the killer, we'll know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.44,0:30:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸上称这个家伙为「切割手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper's calling our guy the "Pontiac Killer."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.34,0:30:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢这个名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.67,0:30:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有什么花样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his pattern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.31,0:30:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尾随年轻女子 然后尸解她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tracks young women, and cuts them apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.11,0:30:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前已知的 有八位受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight victims so far, that we know of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.35,0:30:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约每年一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about one a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any leads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.05,0:30:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问题可真多 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of questions, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 然而…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.33,0:30:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们似乎没有任何答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem to have any answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.95,0:30:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.95,0:30:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.28,0:30:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪呀？没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been? You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to reach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.25,0:31:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 不用了 我没事 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. I'm fine. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.89,0:31:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 需要些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I need some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.96,0:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？缺钱了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? You need money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.42,0:31:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.86,0:31:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.96,0:31:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 你还记得罗尼弗莱内斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, do you remember Lonnie Flennons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然记得 每当我看到他无趣的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do, every time I see his stupid commercials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.23,0:31:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗莱内斯和莫诺翰 律师事务所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flennons and Monohan, Attorneys at Law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.60,0:31:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是名律师？- 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a lawyer? - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别去烦罗尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to leave Lonnie alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.14,0:31:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又穿越时空了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you jump again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实这么做了 是吧？我想我们已经说过这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, didn't you? I thought we talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.85,0:31:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我现在替你担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'm worried about you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.15,0:31:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 珍娜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jenna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.88,0:31:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.45,0:31:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我稍后就来 然后将一切解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be by later, and I'll explain everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.09,0:31:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.63,0:31:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼弗莱内斯在哪间办公室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which office is Lonnie Flennons'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.03,0:31:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,您有预约吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have an appointment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.83,0:31:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是这间吗？- 先生 你不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it this one? - Sir, you can't go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.74,0:31:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 先生 你不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir! Sir! You can't go in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.51,0:31:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能进去 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go in there! Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.61,0:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.27,0:31:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我告诉过他不能进来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I told him he couldn't come in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.78,0:31:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们是老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. We're old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀案那晚你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you the night of the murders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.82,0:32:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵？这是我们的周年纪念日吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Is this our anniversary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.19,0:32:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里 然后每五年问我同一个问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come in here, and you ask me the same question every five years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.26,0:32:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道你当时在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know where you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.86,0:32:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然认为我有嫌疑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still think I was involved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.83,0:32:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.30,0:32:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵？瞧 所有人都知道贝基和伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Look, everybody knows Becky and Elizabeth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.41,0:32:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是切割手的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}were victims of the Pontiac Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.27,0:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 你去哪了 过着原始人的生活呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. Where you been, living under a rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.01,0:32:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你当时在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where you were!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们被杀的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night they were killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.48,0:32:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想在房子边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought of stopping by the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡打电话给我说她父母不在镇里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca called me and told me her parents were out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.32,0:32:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你和伊丽莎白在外面聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you and Elizabeth talking outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.73,0:32:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我该回避\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I should steer clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.36,0:32:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还没告诉你 我和她之间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hadn't told you about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.96,0:32:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我回家了 这就是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went home, and that was that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.40,0:32:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是完全清白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was cleared of all charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.84,0:32:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那我们就说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's just say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.37,0:32:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字已被加回到嫌疑犯名单中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your name's been added back to the suspect pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.95,0:33:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全赞同反对歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all for antidiscrimination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.52,0:33:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的是 我以此为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I made my living at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.35,0:33:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.52,0:33:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼 到底发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么时候发生的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.06,0:33:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时健忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forget things sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.97,0:33:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被搞糊涂了 弄得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get confused. I get mixed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.60,0:33:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「嘿 罗尼 我们聚聚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, Lonnie, let's get together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.44,0:33:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝上几杯「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a drink."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后1杯变成了20杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one drink turns into 20 drinks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那天晚上你叫了辆计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you get a cab that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.24,0:33:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久以前的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long ago was this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.21,0:33:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,2003年 6月6日\N{\fnArial\fs30}June 6th, 2003.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.15,0:33:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后五年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was five years after the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.35,0:33:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.43,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 很长一段时间里 我深信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for the longest time, I was convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.46,0:33:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了布朗姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you killed the Brown sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.24,0:34:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡常担心你会发现我和她的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca was always afraid you'd find out about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.61,0:34:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总以为你在监视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always thought you were watching her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.11,0:34:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 在转角处监视 窥探\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, waiting around the corner, spying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了她们吗 塞姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill them, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.58,0:34:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.50,0:34:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了几年教你如何使用能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent years teaching you to use your gift, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.67,0:34:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在你已经创造了切割手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you've created the Pontiac Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.38,0:34:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽管如此 我能弥补 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can fix it, though. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我比这个时间早一小时回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I just jump back to the night Rebecca and Elizabeth were killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.72,0:34:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡和伊丽莎白被谋杀的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}except an hour earlier this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.65,0:34:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 那不会有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.19,0:34:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.12,0:34:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到一个你已经回到过的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go back to a time that you've already jumped, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.56,0:35:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会把你脑子烧坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to end up frying your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.49,0:35:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 别闻那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, don't sniff that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.16,0:35:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你真的想 接下来一个小时都瘫痪在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you really want to lie on the floor here paralyzed for the next hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.87,0:35:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的… 是布蓉达嘎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That right there… that's Burundanga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是恶魔的呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Devil's Breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.21,0:35:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你种这些是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you grow this because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.31,0:35:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是该死的底特律 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fucking Detroit, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我窗子下放些这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a few of those under my window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比买防盗警铃便宜多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheaper than buying a burglar alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那如果我回到凶杀案四小时前会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what if I go back four hours before the murders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.66,0:35:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 我已经创造了一个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, I've created a serial killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.26,0:35:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 这里有你能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here's what you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.50,0:35:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有八宗谋杀案 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there's eight murders, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 回到另外一个那时候 第三个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So go back to the next one, victim number three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.61,0:35:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 那伊丽莎白怎么办？- 不 不 不 停 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, wait. What about Elizabeth? - No, no, no. Stop. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.48,0:35:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to stick to the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.48,0:35:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.42,0:35:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只看就好 只能看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just observe. Observe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.42,0:36:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你常做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.39,0:36:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个第三号受害者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This victim number three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.89,0:36:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你认识的人 没错吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's nobody you know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.49,0:36:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.69,0:36:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.73,0:36:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你记住杀手的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you ID the killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.27,0:36:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 确定无疑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, beyond the shadow of a frickin' doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.54,0:36:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you go to the police, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.11,0:36:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们留个言 把他告发\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop them a note, turn him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.88,0:36:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的只有一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's just one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.85,0:36:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会深深地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be altering…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.65,0:36:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变整件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the course of events significantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.52,0:36:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么当你回来时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when you get back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.86,0:36:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 如果它成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you come back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.19,0:36:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.87,0:36:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我想不起来了 刚才我们说到哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, I lost my train of thought. What were we talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.13,0:36:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 德伯格 我想我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Goldburg. I think I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.07,0:36:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来的时候 那个杀人狂魔已经在监狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come back, the serial killer's behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人狂魔 对 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial killer. That's right. Yeah. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,关进监狱 对 很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind the bars. Yeah. That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:37:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 德伯格 你真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Goldburg. You're brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 是 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant. Yeah, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.85,0:37:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你会说「真性感」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were going to say "sexy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.82,0:37:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.35,0:37:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会度过非常美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still going to have a good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等下 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait. Don't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.33,0:37:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜订了地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna put in an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.83,0:37:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天不能过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get over there today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.41,0:37:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能来太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice of you to show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.68,0:37:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 收拾好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Cleaned up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.45,0:37:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.09,0:37:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号受害者 阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victim number three, Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.79,0:37:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.16,0:37:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我又不认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I don't know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是和平常一样的 我回去查明了罪犯的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is business as usual. I pop back and ID the perp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.80,0:37:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting you do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.64,0:37:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次你回去 都会有人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you go back, people die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.47,0:38:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道还不明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you learn that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.91,0:38:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察没有任何计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police don't have any leads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一能阻止他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who can stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.98,0:38:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧 塞姆 还要把事情搞到多糟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think this through, Sam. How bad does it have to get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.61,0:38:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.88,0:38:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次我不会再帮你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not helping you this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.27,0:38:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 德伯格跟你问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Goldburg says hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.39,0:38:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 三号受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, victim number three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.86,0:38:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.56,0:38:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,2000年九月五号\N{\fnArial\fs30}September 5th, 2000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.26,0:38:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,米勒顿街5133号\N{\fnArial\fs30}5133 Millerton Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,米勒顿5133号\N{\fnArial\fs30}5133 Millerton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.23,0:39:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,米勒顿5133号\N{\fnArial\fs30}5133 Millerton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯 三号受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes, victim number three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧 等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch. Just watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.79,0:39:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.72,0:39:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真是我的心灵伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my soul mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.30,0:40:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.52,0:40:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 他妈的给我起来 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! Get the fuck up, bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.32,0:41:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能听见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's going to hear you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.55,0:41:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.49,0:41:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.02,0:41:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的闭嘴 我发誓我他妈会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up! I swear I will fucking kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.96,0:41:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看我 别看我 别看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me! Don't look at me! Don't look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.53,0:41:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.24,0:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见我说的没有？听见了吗？你他妈的听见我说的没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? Do you hear me? Do you fucking hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.14,0:41:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说「是的 我听见了 是 我听见了」 - 是 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say, "Yes, I hear you. Yes, I hear you." - Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的脖子弄断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fucking snap your neck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.38,0:41:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.51,0:41:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.05,0:41:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴 听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up! You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的闭嘴 打开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up! Open…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.19,0:41:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.40,0:41:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.43,0:41:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.74,0:41:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.74,0:41:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连句完整的话都说不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even say the safe word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.74,0:42:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 但是你做的好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do this. - But you were doing great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.98,0:42:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.88,0:42:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么喊叫的时候我根本硬不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get hard when you're screaming and crying like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.18,0:42:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真烦人 我只是… - 你知道我很享受这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's upsetting. I just… - You know I'm enjoying this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.62,0:42:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯摩说如果我们把这当作游戏 我们就会乐在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cosmo said if we treat this like a game, we can have fun with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.06,0:42:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道斯摩说的 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Cosmo says, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.26,0:42:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我是说 我们得想想办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it. I mean, we need to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.13,0:42:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则 我们怎么让它变的有趣呢… - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Otherwise, how are we going to spice… - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.13,0:42:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都在提醒我 不是吗？但是这个太他妈奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me all the time, okay? But this shit is weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.70,0:42:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉不对 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It feels wrong. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.41,0:42:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为我乐在其中 - 但是我也乐在其中啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because I'm enjoying it. - But I'm enjoying it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该享受强奸你的过程啊 真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't enjoy raping you. That's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.38,0:42:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是把这想的太严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're completely overanalyzing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.38,0:42:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道 每次我一想到这个 我就硬不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know. Every time I start thinking, I can't get hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.28,0:42:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就 让我的情绪很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, like, fucking up my vibe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.25,0:42:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的思维已经跑了一百万米…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now my mind's racing a million mi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.49,0:42:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.09,0:42:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.72,0:42:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找调解人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go get the accommodator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.77,0:42:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck? - I can explain this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.50,0:42:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在衣橱里干什么呢 你这个疯子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in the closet, you pervert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.91,0:43:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是疯子？- 对 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm the pervert? - Yes, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.84,0:43:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上离开这 混蛋 否则我要叫警察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you out of here, pendejo, or I'll call the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.48,0:43:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck you talking about, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.32,0:43:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你租了我的沙发 你得给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rent my couch, you pay me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.05,0:43:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果不给钱 就去找其它的地方睡觉 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't pay me, you find somewhere else to sleep, pendejo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.39,0:43:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 伙计 我会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, man. I'll be out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.12,0:43:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下周或上上周之前就会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be out of here next week or the week before last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.49,0:43:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前 你他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago. Fuck you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.80,0:43:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.80,0:43:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.20,0:44:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 你在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.80,0:45:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.43,0:45:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.23,0:45:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 别害怕 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Don't be scared, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.47,0:45:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 - 我只想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from me. - I just need to ask you a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.80,0:45:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个你的法院制止令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a restraining order against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.60,0:45:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你是那个躲在衣柜里的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You're that perv from the closet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 不 听着 听我解释 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No, listen. I can explain that, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.34,0:45:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想保护你 我觉得我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to protect you, and I think it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.01,0:45:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我需要知道你为什么还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to figure out why you're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.18,0:45:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 叫警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody please help! Call the cops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.58,0:45:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen! - Please help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.65,0:45:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识一个叫罗尼弗莱内斯的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever known somebody named Lonnie Flennons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.52,0:45:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 别 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please help! - No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.62,0:46:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I know her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.38,0:46:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.98,0:46:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.51,0:46:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不好 看看你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not. Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.55,0:46:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是点辣椒粉喷雾 我很好 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just pepper spray. I'm fine. - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.48,0:46:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.85,0:46:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看看 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see. - I'm fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.13,0:46:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯这个名字 对你而言有什么意义吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the name Anita Barnes mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.40,0:46:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你单独行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jumped without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.93,0:46:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你知道这有多危险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, do you know how dangerous that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.90,0:46:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会被淹死 你的大脑会被压扁 - 我不能只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could drown. Your brain could boil. - I can't just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.64,0:46:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不想听你的长篇大论 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a lecture from you right now, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.27,0:46:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need to know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.58,0:47:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道的是为什么 阿妮塔巴恩斯还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need to figure out is why Anita Barnes is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.28,0:47:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我单独行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I jumped. I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.58,0:47:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去了 以为我能看见她被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back, and I was supposed to witness her murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,切割手的第三个受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was victim number three of the Pontiac Killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.99,0:47:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我回来了 只是… - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I come back, and it's just… - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不知道了 就像一堆转来转去的迷题一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I don't know. It's like all the pieces of the puzzle just shifted around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.30,0:47:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能解释这些的人是德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person who could explain it to me is Goldburg, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.76,0:47:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he's disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.57,0:47:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 太合时宜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, conveniently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.74,0:47:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说那话是什么意思？- 塞姆 他会成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that mean? - Sam, he was going to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.41,0:47:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你和谋杀案联系在一起的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn in evidence linking you to the murders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.98,0:47:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有从过去转送的那么快的话 你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn't fast forwarded through your past, you'd know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.91,0:47:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.45,0:47:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你相信我 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you trust me, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.19,0:47:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你有任何理由做这件事的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you're doing this for any reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.66,0:47:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会阻止你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never turn you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.23,0:47:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.94,0:48:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 布朗杀人案的那个晚上 我掩护了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, the night of the Brown murders, I covered for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.21,0:48:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you weren't at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我在哪 我想救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where I was! I tried to save them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.95,0:48:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你不知道两周前发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you don't know what happened two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.45,0:48:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道我没杀任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know I didn't kill anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.29,0:48:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许不是现在 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Maybe not now, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.62,0:48:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果时空穿越把你弄疯了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if with the jumping you go crazy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.79,0:48:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来的某一天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometime in the future…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.16,0:48:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你从来就不提这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you don't talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.67,0:48:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不说 把它控制的严严实实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't talk about anything. You just bottle it all up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.17,0:48:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至从没提过着火 的时候到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never even talked about what happened in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.48,0:48:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你… 是你放的火吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you… Did you start the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.86,0:49:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.11,0:49:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.48,0:49:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了你的葬礼 他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to your funeral, for fuck's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.99,0:49:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害别人 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt people, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.92,0:49:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有那么做 我在帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do that. I help people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.26,0:49:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了？我 我帮助… 我弥补了那些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? I-I help… I fix things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.09,0:49:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我做的 这就是我做过的 我回到过去 弥补那些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I do. That's what I did! I went back, and I fixed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.40,0:49:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我弥补了它 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fixed it, Jenna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.43,0:49:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么你在这 我可以弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here, because I fix things!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.34,0:49:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 但是有的时候你并不能弥补一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, but sometimes you can't fix everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时事情就是会变得他妈的一团糟 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes things are just fucked, Jenna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.21,0:49:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且… 而且现在 事情就已经有点变糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… And right now, things are kind of fucked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.48,0:49:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.55,0:49:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在试着… 我在试着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm try… I'm try…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.22,0:49:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在试着弥补 但是… - 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying to fix it, but it… - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.29,0:49:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.12,0:49:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太笨了或者我太… 我太软弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too stupid or I'm too… I'm too weak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.16,0:50:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它… 它只是… - 塞姆 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's… I… It's just… - Sam. Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.43,0:50:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.66,0:50:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时空穿越\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the jumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.53,0:50:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让警察履行一次他们的职责吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let the police do their job for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.61,0:50:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.04,0:50:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证你再也不会做时空穿越了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you're not going to jump anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.35,0:50:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.99,0:50:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弥补的 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix it, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.09,0:50:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.41,0:51:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.84,0:51:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 大伙儿 - 晚安 维基\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, guys. - Night, Vicki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.85,0:51:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.05,0:51:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没想过假如你能 回到过去改变一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever wonder how your life would be different{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.18,0:51:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人生会有怎样的变化？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could go back and change one thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.45,0:51:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 每个人都这么想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Everyone thinks about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.35,0:51:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.65,0:51:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 想听个笑话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, want to hear a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.62,0:51:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.26,0:51:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把贵妃鸡和黄牛混起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you get when you mix a brown chicken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.53,0:51:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,会得到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a brown cow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.53,0:51:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 会得到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. What do you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.66,0:51:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵妃鸡 黄牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown chicken, brown cow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.83,0:51:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.47,0:51:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 维基 你晚点想不想过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Vicki, you want to come over later?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.81,0:52:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的邀请 但我要回我男人那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the offer, but I got to get home to my man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.38,0:52:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.08,0:52:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.92,0:52:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许下辈子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe in another life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.15,0:52:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 下辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. In another life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.20,0:52:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.57,0:52:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 塞姆 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Sam. - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.10,0:52:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵妃鸡 黄牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown chicken, brown cow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.10,0:53:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.08,0:53:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.55,0:53:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许预约取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess the engagement's off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.12,0:53:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到的就只有这些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.99,0:53:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,法医修复了一具烧焦的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forensics recovered a charred body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.49,0:53:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据显示其符合东车厂的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}matching a description at the Eastern body plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.19,0:53:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.30,0:53:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 除非是最后一位客人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Unless it was the last customer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.67,0:54:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,酱汁不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good sauce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.69,0:54:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go over it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.42,0:54:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚几点离开酒吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time did you leave the bar last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.29,0:54:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I was drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.03,0:54:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你室友说你大概三点到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your roommate says you got in about 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.33,0:54:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀案在凌晨2：30发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murders took place at 2:30 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.76,0:54:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你那到酒吧要走多久路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is the walk from the bar to your place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.00,0:54:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个小时吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About half an hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.67,0:54:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得我是那个切割手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm the Pontiac Killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.97,0:54:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是布朗姐妹谋杀案的嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a person of interest in the Brown murders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.44,0:54:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你妹妹为你提供了不在场证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you got off on your sister's alibi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.78,0:54:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在罗尼弗莱内斯死前一天去找过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed up at Lonnie Flennons' the day before he dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.78,0:54:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你刚好又在那天晚上出现在酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you just happen to be at the bar the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.82,0:54:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,维基最有一次剪指甲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicki gets her last manicure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.49,0:54:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 格伦 别这么说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Glenn. Don't talk about her like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.86,0:54:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟猪似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.70,0:55:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们需要隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess they need their privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.68,0:55:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm going to tell you how it's going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.81,0:55:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.68,0:55:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会承认自己是疯子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to plead insanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.35,0:55:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要证明给你看你他妈的就是个人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to testify myself to what a crazy motherfucker you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.72,0:55:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你继续胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you keep giving me this tired-ass song and dance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.15,0:55:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为自己能阻止切割手\N{\fnArial\fs30}about trying to stop the Pontiac Killer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.72,0:55:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你会和那些神经病关在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure you're locked up in county with them big old boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.33,0:55:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你觉得爽了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now don't it just make your asshole pucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.36,0:55:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.74,0:55:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妹妹来了 带了一个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sister's here. She's got a lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.81,0:55:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢？- 她请来了博斯维奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - She's got Boswich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.05,0:55:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.45,0:55:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有足够证据定罪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got enough for a conviction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.25,0:56:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all circumstantial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.42,0:56:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.75,0:56:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去停尸间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the auto body plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.82,0:56:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫瞄指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweep for fingerprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.76,0:56:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能发现些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what else you can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.43,0:56:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经去过了 - 再认真找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were already there. - Then look harder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.60,0:56:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要拿这个神经病怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do about psychic boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.10,0:56:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.10,0:56:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们只能让他走了 - 跟踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to let him walk. - Put a tail on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.68,0:56:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年老虎队看起来状态不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tigers are looking good this year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.65,0:56:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 他们放他出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. They're letting him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.26,0:56:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦警官 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Glenn, we got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.96,0:56:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉 - 我也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I'm sorry, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.54,0:56:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.31,0:56:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上过得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.50,0:57:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,东车厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eastern body plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.98,0:57:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察在那找到切割手的受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where the police found the Pontiac Killer's victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.61,0:57:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,2004年9月19号 2004年9月19号\N{\fnArial\fs30}September 19, 2004. September 19, 2004.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.45,0:57:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拉屎 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to take a shit, pendejo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.82,0:57:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.19,0:57:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我烦死你那他妈的「五分钟」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of your fucking "five minutes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.79,0:57:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道混蛋是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what pendejo means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.96,0:57:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.10,0:57:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不付租金就给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't pay rent, you leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.10,0:57:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毫不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.20,0:57:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,2004年9月19号\N{\fnArial\fs30}September 19, 2004.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.64,0:58:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警察发现受害人的旧车厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old auto body plant where the police find the victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.04,0:58:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们查清楚了 切割手什么时候回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They figured it out. When did the Pontiac Killer start coming here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.31,0:58:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他要折磨受害人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he torture his victims?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.28,0:58:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.35,0:58:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看着他的脸 盯着他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see his face, look into his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.95,0:58:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.69,0:58:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看见他的脸 盯着他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see his face, look into his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.75,1:00:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.82,1:01:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在中午前不要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sleep until noon today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.22,1:01:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把机密文件留在了咖啡桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving the classifieds on the coffee table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.29,1:01:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能看看上面有没有适合你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can look and see if there's a job in there for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.36,1:01:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.30,1:01:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作 今天是周一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work. It's Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.53,1:01:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.57,1:01:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗯 我六点回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, I'll be back at 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.84,1:01:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来做饭 是吗？- 我做饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're going to cook dinner, right? - I make dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.87,1:01:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你说过你会打扫卫生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said you were going to clean up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.81,1:01:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划听起来有些恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little project of yours is starting to look kind of scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.96,1:01:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,切割手 八个受害人 都是女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pontiac Killer. Eight victims, all women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.73,1:01:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他杀了罗尼弗莱内斯 七个受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he killed Lonnie Flennons. Seven victims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.00,1:01:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个女人 一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven women, one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.40,1:01:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把尸体藏起来 他会放到哪里去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hides their bodies. Where does he take them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.37,1:01:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,东车厂 他为什么要放到那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eastern body plant. Why does he take them there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.27,1:01:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些受害人有被虐待的痕迹 其他的是立即死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some victims have signs of torture, others killed immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.11,1:01:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的计划是什么？他怎么会没别人发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his pattern? How does he get out undetected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.54,1:02:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居们都没见怪声 他一定是晚上去的… 晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neighbors never hear him. He must go at night… at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.18,1:02:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 他是住在那吗？他是在附近工作吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, does he live there? Does he work nearby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.75,1:02:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要找到他 我要回去 我要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to find him. I've got to go back. I've got to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.93,1:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些女人有什么共同之处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did these women all have in common?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.37,1:02:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么… 他们之间有什么联系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the… What's the connection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙要干嘛 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this guy about, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.51,1:02:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.69,1:02:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯 她快把我烦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes. That's the one that's killing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.23,1:02:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 那有个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see. There was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.47,1:02:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 王八蛋 别动 他妈的别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, motherfucker! Not a move! Not a fucking move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.50,1:02:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跪下 - 他妈的给我跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On your knees! - On your fucking knees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.01,1:03:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 他妈的趴下 脸朝下 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move down! Get the fuck down! Face down! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.51,1:03:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他一巴掌 - 把手放到背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cuff him. - Hands behind your back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.24,1:03:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他们进来 - 好的 叫进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call them up. - All right. Call it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.86,1:03:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.96,1:03:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的都计划好了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really had this all mapped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.67,1:03:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.31,1:03:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你是个神经病 但这一切都是你造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be a nut job, but you sure made this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.04,1:03:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个惊天大案\N{\fnArial\fs30}a slam-dunk case for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.51,1:03:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女朋友 贝基 给你戴绿帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your girlfriend, Becky, cheats on you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.82,1:03:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.32,1:03:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你杀了她姐姐 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you kill her sister because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.89,1:03:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道… 杀一送一？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… Bonus points?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.76,1:03:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友 德伯格 准备指证你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pal Goldburg was going to testify against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他突然消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he disappears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.16,1:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你杀了罗尼弗莱内斯 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you kill Lonnie Flennons. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.66,1:04:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不是的 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. No. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼 将要被执行死刑 我必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonnie was going to be executed. I had to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.10,1:04:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的到底在说什么？最后的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck you talking about? The next victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.87,1:04:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.81,1:04:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿妮塔巴恩斯 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anita Barnes. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.31,1:04:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯 阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes. Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.18,1:04:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我… 是他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I… Did he…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.25,1:04:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他杀了阿妮塔巴恩斯吗？- 我不知道 你告诉我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he kill Anita Barnes? - I don't know. You tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.42,1:04:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我杀了阿妮塔巴恩斯吗？- 不知道 你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I kill Anita Barnes? - No. You tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.08,1:04:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 切割手的最后一个受害人什么时候死的？- 听着 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When was the last Pontiac victim? - Look, fuck-stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.25,1:04:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我问你 你杀了多少个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking the questions here. How many did you kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.03,1:04:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.80,1:04:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.05,1:04:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.68,1:04:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打电话 然后你打给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get one call, and you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.95,1:04:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算把我开除？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to get me fired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.55,1:04:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 我想要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, I got to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.36,1:05:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 我是认真的 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, I'm serious, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.73,1:05:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那杀手还在外面 我是唯一能阻止他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer is still out there, and I'm the only one who can stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.56,1:05:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据联合警察部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the joint police department, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那切割手就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Pontiac Killer's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.77,1:05:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你相信凶手不是我 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! You don't believe it's me, Glenn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.64,1:05:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我惹得麻烦已经够多了 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in enough trouble as it is, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.37,1:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.31,1:05:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a psychic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.28,1:05:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我可以穿梭时空\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - I time travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.88,1:05:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以回到任何地方 我可以观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go back to wherever I was, and I can watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.39,1:05:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这取决于发生什么 我能改变事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And depending upon what happens, I change things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.79,1:05:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常是偶然的 但有时是有目的的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually on accident but sometimes on purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.29,1:05:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever call me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.46,1:05:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是事实 格伦 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's true! Glenn! Glenn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.87,1:05:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你妻子在小加斯科 的16岁生日聚会上相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met your wife at Tiny Gasco's sweet-16 party!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.94,1:05:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲有一辆塔克货车 还为邻居们请来了乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her dad got a taco cart and a band for the neighborhood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.74,1:05:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子走过来向你邀舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife came up and asked you to dance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.78,1:05:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他跟你说的第一句话是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the first thing she ever said to you was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.65,1:05:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是M.C。Hammer吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you M.C. Hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.17,1:06:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回到过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到的 - 什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw it. - When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.14,1:06:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 当你第一次问我的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years ago, when you first started asking me about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.71,1:06:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在挽救这件事啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was saving it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.58,1:06:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something like this, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.18,1:06:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.19,1:06:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll help me out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.36,1:06:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.39,1:06:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hammer？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.89,1:06:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以当作是个笔误 文书上的小差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going down as a clerical error. Glitch in the paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.86,1:06:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它只能给你2个多小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it'll only buy you a couple more hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.33,1:06:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦尼古拉斯发现了 他会把你抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once Nicholas finds out, he'll bring you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.84,1:06:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会再让我见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way he'll let me see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.41,1:06:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to think of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.91,1:06:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会在几个小时内失去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably won't have a job in a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.65,1:07:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要抓住那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You catch that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna. Jenna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.43,1:07:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 是我 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, it's me! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.24,1:07:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 开门 再不开我要踢门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, open up the door! I'm going to kick it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.47,1:07:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能踢开门 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't kicking down shit, motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.51,1:07:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在你他妈的安静点 - 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now you need to quiet your ass down! - Open up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.71,1:07:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.78,1:07:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维斯小姐 你能开下我妹妹的门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Davis, will you open my sister's door for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.75,1:07:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不开呢 - 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ain't opening up shit! - Let me into her apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.55,1:07:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会… 等等 - 你有他妈的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ain't gonna… Wait! - You got the fucking keys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.85,1:07:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你他妈的钥匙呢？- 戴维斯小姐 你他妈的能不能闭嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your fucking key? - Miss Davis, would you shut the fuck up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.09,1:07:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能抓住我 - 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ain't about to get me! - Let me into this apartment!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.06,1:07:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把手放我身上 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't put your hands on me, motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.79,1:07:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要逼我砍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me have to cut you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.73,1:07:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 把你送进监狱都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Too fucking old to go to prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.76,1:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好进去后尽快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get your trifling ass in and out of here as soon as possible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.67,1:07:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 哦 巴结我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Oh, kiss my ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.10,1:07:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.26,1:08:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「最喜爱的顾客」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Favorite customer"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.17,1:08:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 别闻那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, don't sniff that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.10,1:08:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非接下来几小时你想瘫痪躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you really want to lie on the floor here paralyzed for the next hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.73,1:10:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.30,1:10:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 你在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.87,1:10:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来面对我 你这个混…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out and face me, you son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.98,1:10:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.47,1:10:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.47,1:10:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.94,1:10:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伯格 你会没事的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldburg, you're going to be all right, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.61,1:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能站起来吗？你能站起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stand up? Can you stand up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.08,1:10:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找人来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get you some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.28,1:10:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？我去找人来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I'm going to get you some help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.61,1:10:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get you help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.42,1:10:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get you help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.65,1:11:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 哦 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.53,1:11:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆my\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.00,1:11:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.00,1:11:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个东西已经夹紧了 来 让我帮你弄开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing is spring loaded. Here. Let me get you out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.91,1:11:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弄开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.74,1:11:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 起来 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Get up. Stand up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.48,1:12:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把它从你脚上弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you out of this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.31,1:12:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脚能出来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you lean out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.09,1:12:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 你在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.12,1:12:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.59,1:12:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我会解决所有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I'll fix everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.86,1:12:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要回到过去 把夹子移走 你就会没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just jump back, and I'll move the trap out of the way. You'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.80,1:12:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也能穿越时空？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can jump? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.13,1:12:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊讶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.37,1:12:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.84,1:12:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.08,1:12:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't realize this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.21,1:12:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经向你解释过无数次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've explained this to you, like, a zillion times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.78,1:12:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很受挫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really frustrating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.32,1:12:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱上了那个妓女 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fell in love with that whore, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.29,1:12:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她却不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.23,1:12:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was cheating on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.13,1:12:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么… 什么妓女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What whore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.70,1:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽贝卡布朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.10,1:12:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 塞姆 清醒点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Sam. Keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.40,1:13:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.18,1:13:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你解决了 一切都很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of it, and everything worked out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.71,1:13:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚者报复了伤害你的罗尼弗莱内斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even got back at Lonnie Flennons for hurting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.39,1:13:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但丽贝卡布朗的白痴妹妹来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Rebecca Brown's stupid sister comes over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.26,1:13:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后… 你决定打破规矩 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… and you decide to break the rules, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.39,1:13:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你不要那么做 会有坏事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to do it. I told you it would be bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.20,1:13:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟着我回到了过去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You followed me back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.00,1:13:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 那么… 那么其他那些女孩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, what about the… What about the other girls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.57,1:13:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么… 你都不认识她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the… You didn't know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.24,1:13:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们只是陌生人 她们对你做过什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were strangers. What did they ever do to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.41,1:13:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没发现吗 塞姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.38,1:13:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们只是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were only strangers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.38,1:13:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我在你认识她们前杀了她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I stopped them before you met them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.22,1:13:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿妮塔巴恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anita Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.92,1:13:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是和你一起去芝加哥的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the whore you went to Chicago with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.26,1:13:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你离开我 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let you leave me, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.30,1:14:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是维基\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Vicki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.50,1:14:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没告诉过我她的事 但还是被我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept her a secret from me, too, but I found out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.97,1:14:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是个好女人 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't a lady, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.97,1:14:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们中没一个好女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them were ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.91,1:14:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 她们… 她们本该是我爱的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, they… they're the women I would've fallen in love with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该… 我本该有个家庭和新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've… I would've had a family, a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.45,1:14:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没发现我做这一切都是为了你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see I did it all for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.29,1:14:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白的 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand that, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.96,1:14:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要折磨她们？你把她们肢解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you torture them? You mutilated them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.49,1:14:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把她们弄成了碎片 - 我没有折磨她们 是她们折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cut them to pieces! - I didn't torture them! They tortured me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.99,1:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们中的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.77,1:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那德伯格呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Goldburg?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.87,1:14:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was catching on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.24,1:14:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须让他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to shut him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.41,1:14:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很像史酷比 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so Scooby-Doo, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.65,1:14:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是那些好管闲事的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've gotten away with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.78,1:14:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该已经逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for those meddling kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.72,1:14:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的疯了 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your fucking mind, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.29,1:14:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.96,1:15:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那不是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.16,1:15:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你总要回去抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn't kept jumping back to catch me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.76,1:15:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能已经收手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.70,1:15:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每次你回去就会有更多的目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every time you went back, there was more witnesses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有更多证据需要掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was more evidence to cover up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.90,1:15:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想挺好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny when you think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.37,1:15:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的创造了个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really did create a serial killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.05,1:15:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你回到过去救我的那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since the day you jumped back and you saved me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.75,1:15:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我只为你而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I'd only live for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.42,1:15:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 珍娜 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jenna. Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.03,1:15:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.76,1:15:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有像我爱你那样爱我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you love me like I love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.07,1:15:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 忘掉其他所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Forget about everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.31,1:15:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们等了一生的重要时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the moment we've waited for our whole lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.95,1:15:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.38,1:16:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我们不像其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we're not like other people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.25,1:16:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们规矩不适用于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their rules don't apply to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.39,1:16:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 珍娜 你… 哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jenna! You're… Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.96,1:16:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 我爱你胜过于一切 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I love you more than anything in the whole world, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.83,1:16:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.10,1:16:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你和我 就像命中注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just you and me like it's meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.60,1:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. No. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.17,1:16:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 塞姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.17,1:16:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？怎么了？怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? What's wrong? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.18,1:16:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.51,1:16:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 你在穿越时空吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, are you jumping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.58,1:16:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.22,1:16:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 不要穿越\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, don't jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.42,1:16:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.29,1:16:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 不要离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, don't you leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.37,1:16:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 珍娜在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, where's Jenna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.54,1:16:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照顾好妈妈 我去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go take care of Mom, and I'll get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.65,1:17:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.02,1:17:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.08,1:17:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去 请你让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out! Please let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.59,1:17:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.66,1:17:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 住手 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, stop! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.99,1:17:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍娜 - 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenna! - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.16,1:17:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞姆 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Listen to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.97,1:17:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要这么做？- 我是你哥哥 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you doing this? - I'm your brother, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.17,1:17:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会一直爱你 - 塞姆 塞姆 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll always love you! - Sam! Sam, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.14,1:17:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有其他办法 - 塞姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no other way! - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.48,1:17:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.28,1:17:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞姆 让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.42,1:17:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Jenna!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.78,1:18:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜在哪 塞姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jenna, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.05,1:18:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jenna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.51,1:18:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 呆子脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, dork-face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.31,1:18:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡的好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sleep well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.45,1:18:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定做梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must've had some kind of dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.45,1:18:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你打鼾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you were snoring away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.05,1:18:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到那了吗？- 是的 珍娜 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we there yet? - Yes, Jenna, we're there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.86,1:18:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.52,1:18:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.49,1:18:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.60,1:19:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉堡包是怎么来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the burgers coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.21,1:19:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here they are. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.04,1:19:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的生日聚会还迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late for your own birthday party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.35,1:19:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.02,1:19:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy Birthday. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.99,1:19:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.59,1:19:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？汉堡包？热狗？还是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want? Burgers? Hot dogs? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要是你做的都行 拿上来吧 - 先喝啤酒吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you're cooking. Throw it on. - Start with a beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.36,1:19:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 嘿 - 生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, sure. Hey! - Happy Birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.09,1:19:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 珍娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jenna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.73,1:19:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you? - I'm good. I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.37,1:19:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.77,1:19:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 亲爱的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, hon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.64,1:19:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - My son!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.60,1:19:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？哦 看到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? Oh, good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.64,1:19:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.07,1:19:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你一定有一两个故事讲 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you got a story or two for us, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.85,1:19:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.35,1:19:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.29,1:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.52,1:19:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 生日快乐 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Happy Birthday. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.32,1:20:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.73,1:20:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给贾尼丝一瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Janice another beer.{\r}
